  "**P2** (`creditrisk/data.py` `profit_p2`): `P2 = (total_pymnt - collection_recovery_fee) * f - funded_amnt`, with `f = (1 - (1+r)^(-T)) / (T * ln(1+r))`, `T = months_to_last_payment / 12` "
